SUMMARY:Around the Table
DESCRIPTION:An interactive activity where children explore how dining tables bring together different cultural practices. The program introduces a range of customs and habits from around the world\, showing how the way people gather\, sit\, and share meals can differ from one place to another. Through simple role-play\, children take part in everyday moments such as greeting others\, welcoming guests\, and spending time around a table.
LOCATION:Ithra - Children's Museum
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-around-the-table.html
END:VEVENT
